# Taraz behind patient-book's Caddy. Rendered by ops/deploy.sh into
# /opt/caddy/sites/taraz.caddy (TARAZ_DOMAIN from .env), which patient-book's
# Caddyfile imports. Caddy obtains and renews the certificate on its own.
${TARAZ_DOMAIN} {
	encode zstd gzip

	header {
		Strict-Transport-Security "max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains"
		-Server
	}

	# JSON and the reviewed Excel file only.
	request_body {
		max_size 5MB
	}

	# Taraz sets its own CSP, cache and security headers.
	reverse_proxy taraz:8000 {
		health_uri /api/health
	}
}
